# Build context for the server images. Secrets never enter an image: env is supplied at run time (env files / the
# instance), so every .env* stays out of the context.
**/.env*
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.claude
.agents
.cursor
.devin
.superpowers
docs
deploy
docker-compose.yml
scripts/evals/results
